Package: flowjoRpipeline
Title: Modular FlowJo Time-Course and Dose-Response Cytometry Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yijiu", "Lu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Modular R workflow for ingesting FlowJo exported summary tables, validating 96-well plate metadata, computing replicate SEM with quadrature error propagation, and generating layered ggplot2 figures.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    ggplot2,
    scales,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
